###Listar
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/sucursal?page=1&limit=3&search=central

###Registrar
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/sucursal
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nombre":"Sucursal Central",
    "direccion":"Av. Principal 123",
    "telefono":"555-1234",
    "ciudad":"La Paz"
}

###mostrar
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/sucursal/1

###modificar
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/sucursal/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nombre":"Sucursal Central Actualizada",
    "direccion":"Av. Principal 456",
    "telefono":"555-9999",
    "ciudad":"Santa Cruz"
}

###eliminar
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/sucursal/1
